exception; see section 7.

2. Permitted use

You may download, install and use the Software to extract and deliver data
from databases that you own or are authorized to operate.

The community edition is free of charge. It extracts up to 10,000 rows per
table or view and writes output locally. Unlimited extraction and cloud upload
require a valid DLH.io API key. That use is also governed by the
DLH.io Terms and Conditions
(https://datalakehouse.io/legal/terms-and-conditions) and, where applicable,
the DLH.io Data Processing Addendum
(https://datalakehouse.io/legal/data-processing-addendum) or your separate
written agreement with AICG, Inc.

